cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite both the software archive and the paper below."
title: "MOIRAI L3: array-level versus per-trace P/S phase picking on real downhole 3-C arrays (AMBER)"
abstract: >-
  Code, EMA-best model weights and reproducible figure/table scripts for a
  leave-one-site-out, confound-free benchmark of array versus per-trace deep
  learning for borehole microseismic phase picking on the AMBER benchmark.
type: software
authors:
