# Concept DOI: always resolves to the latest version.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21217614"
keywords:
  - seismology
  - phase picking
  - borehole microseismic
  - induced seismicity
  - deep learning
  - leave-one-site-out
  - array moveout
